The avatars in this folder are from the Microsoft Rocketbox avatar library
(https://github.com/microsoft/Microsoft-Rocketbox), converted to GLB (meshopt-compressed)
with their Oculus visemes and ARKit blend shapes kept:

  female.glb  Rocketbox business female 04
  male.glb    Rocketbox business male 01

They are used and redistributed under the MIT License below.

